"690\" data-end=\"730\">Unieke combinatie van Mario en Rabbids</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"767\">Strategische turn-based gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"811\">Humoristische en kleurrijke presentatie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"841\">Geschikt voor jong en oud</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"888\">Volledig getest en direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"899\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"911\"><strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"911\">€ 19,99</strong></p>",
